    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.HEADSPACE is a 2D adventure game that combines pixel art and hand drawn styles to immerse the player in a psychological adventure through a fractured landscape. Play as an unknown wanderer who has lost his memory and interact with a diverse cast of characters who may or may not have your best interest at heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual novel, walking sim, and light puzzling elements weave together as you strive to unlock who you are and how to get home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Featuring music, sound, and voice work by Magic From Space. </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.HEADSPACE is a 2D adventure game that combines pixel art and hand drawn styles to immerse the player in a psychological adventure through a fractured landscape. Play as an unknown wanderer who has lost his memory and interact with a diverse cast of characters who may or may not have your best interest at heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual novel, walking sim, and light puzzling elements weave together as you strive to unlock who you are and how to get home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Featuring music, sound, and voice work by Magic From Space. </p>",
    "short_description": ".HEADSPACE is a 2D adventure game that combines pixel art and hand drawn styles to immerse the player in a psychological adventure through a fractured landscape. Alone and unsure of who you are, gain clarity, confidence and connection to reawaken yourself and recall your true purpose.",
